
---

# 🧱 **.gitignore** (for .NET + SQLite + VS Code)

```gitignore
# Build directories
bin/
obj/

# User-specific files
*.user
*.userosscache
*.suo
*.cache
*.tmp

# SQLite database
src/DotNetRestApiApp/app.db
src/DotNetRestApiApp/app.db-shm
src/DotNetRestApiApp/app.db-wal

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# NuGet
.nuget/
packages/
*.nupkg
project.lock.json

# DotNet local tools
.config/

# Publish directory
publish/

# Resharper
_ReSharper*/
*.DotSettings.user

# Rider
.idea/

# Backup files
*.swp
*.bak
*.old

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
